    "directions": [
      "Using a mortar and pestle, crush the pepper, coriander, and cumin to a chunky powder. Add the cilantro roots, garlic, red pepper, and salt, and pound to a rough paste. Work in the oil and vinegar, mashing it all well together. Massage this mixture into the beef chunks and let it come to room temperature, covered. (Alternatively, you may prepare ahead to this point and chill until ready to proceed.)",
      "Prepare a medium-hot bed of hardwood coals.",
      "Thread meat and vegetables alternately on bamboo or metal skewers. Grill, turning to brown all sides.",
      "Slip off skewers and toss with chopped cilantro before serving."
    ],
